# Code owners for lakebase-solutions.
# GitHub auto-requests a review from the owner(s) on every PR that touches a
# matching path, and (with "Require review from Code Owners" branch protection)
# blocks merge until they approve.
#
# Entries use GitHub usernames or teams (NOT emails):
#   *                 @sqlchaser            # a user owns everything
#   /modules/         @org/team-slug        # a team owns a path (e.g. @databricks-solutions/lakebase)
# Later patterns win over earlier ones. To route a path to a team, add its slug
# (Settings → Teams) and grant the team write access to the repo.

# Default owner for the whole repository.
*   @sqlchaser
